<title>RUSSIA: Russia 96 non-CIS aluminium export 2.6mln T-agency.</title>
<headline>Russia 96 non-CIS aluminium export 2.6mln T-agency.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian primary aluminium exports outside the Commonwealth of Independent States (CIS) rose to 2.62 million tonnes in 1996 from 2.25 million tonnes in 1995, Interfax news agency quoted State Statistics Committee figures as showing on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Russia's non-CIS exports of primary nickel rose to 166,900 tonnes in 1996 from 152,500 tonnes in 1995, Interfax said.  </p>
<p>The committee said non-CIS copper exports totalled 527,400 tonnes in 1996, up from 466,800 in 1995.</p>
<p>The Statistics Committee provided the following data for Russian non-CIS metal exports (tonnes) --</p>
<p>			     1996			1995 Aluminium</p>
<p>2,616,900 2,249,900 Copper 527,400 466,800 Nickel 166,900 152,500</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +095 941 8520</p>
</text>
